WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.743
- Hello.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.200
What's your name?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.270
What's my name?

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.852
Hello.

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:11.370
(mellow music)

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:14.469
- It's a team effort, like
it's genuinely a team effort.

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:16.460
- Come, come.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.137
See for yourself.

00:00:19.932 --> 00:00:22.515
(mellow music)

00:00:30.116 --> 00:00:31.116
- Wonderful.

00:00:35.677 --> 00:00:37.273
- She hits him so first.

00:00:38.641 --> 00:00:40.300
(clangs)

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.313
She told you to let go.

00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:45.040
- Go?

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.640
Leave?

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.680
No, no, no.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.340
Still much to do, plan not yet done.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.283
Chamberlain will decide when
Gruenak service is finished.

00:00:56.212 --> 00:00:57.705
- Excuse me.

00:00:57.705 --> 00:01:00.872
Thank you, if I could just, excuse me.

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:10.483
(carriage crashes)

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.040
(adventurous music)

00:01:49.032 --> 00:01:50.449
- We are eternal.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.720
- So our standard height here,

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.480
we have four foot high rostrums.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:00.630
There's the finished set floor

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:01.690
and then the set sits on top.

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:03.480
And that's so we can open up the floor

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.830
to drop the puppeteers in to have

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.530
the creatures at the right height.

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.890
- I've never seen such a creature before.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:15.043
Good day.

00:02:20.638 --> 00:02:21.596
(growls)

00:02:21.596 --> 00:02:23.429
(yells)

00:02:23.429 --> 00:02:24.262
- Woo.

00:02:24.262 --> 00:02:25.840
- Ya, ya.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.007
(squeals)

00:02:29.272 --> 00:02:31.272
(barks)

00:02:32.456 --> 00:02:34.706
(crunches)

00:02:37.627 --> 00:02:40.101
- My name's Deet, I'm a Gelfling.

00:02:40.101 --> 00:02:42.018
- How very interesting.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.163
- It's not about size.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.883
It's about vigor.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.910
(adventurous music)

00:03:36.252 --> 00:03:38.490
- Oh Sanctuary Tree,

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.730
we have not spoken in a long time.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:42.770
- There's something wonderful about

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:44.430
knowing you can pause any frame

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.680
and that no moment in
there is an accident.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.900
Every leaf you see has been placed there.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.526
Every movement of the
character has been considered.

00:03:51.526 --> 00:03:54.609
(creatures clicking)

00:04:18.631 --> 00:04:21.464
(creature snarls)

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.823
- Now go.

00:04:26.823 --> 00:04:28.350
You heroes of Thra.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.073
Go and save our world.

00:04:32.914 --> 00:04:36.304
(adventurous music)

00:04:36.304 --> 00:04:37.971
- [Man] Tell no one.

